  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EUROCLIMA+ 2017 Regional Climate Change and Environmental Sustainability Programme with Latin America (AECID)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of EUROCLIMA+ is to contribute to environmentally sustainable and more climate-resilient development of Latin America. The specific objective of the Water Management sector will be to strengthen the resilience of urban areas to climate change trough a better water management. The specific objective of the Reneweable Energies and Energy Efficiency will be to promote policy and governance frameworks as well as actions and investments that encourage both RE and EE for CC mitigation</narrative>
  </description>
